Package: earthschedule
Title: Teaching Schedule Planner for the Department of Earth Sciences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Sebastian", family = "Kopf",
      email = "sebastian.kopf@colorado.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2044-0201")
    )
Description: A 'shiny' app for viewing and planning the teaching schedule of the
    Department of Earth Sciences at CU Boulder. Faculty can add planned classes
    and teaching absences for upcoming semesters. The schedule data is stored in
    a Google spreadsheet accessed with a Google service account.
